###### REPORTS (authority: report.read — ADMIN & CASHIER) ######
### Dashboard summary - default (today, Asia/Jakarta)
### Report membaca langsung dari fakta domain (tanpa tabel projection):
###   sales.cash.*    ← payment: applied_amount (uang masuk ke tagihan)
###   sales.billing.* ← invoice: settled_amount saat lunas, piutang berjalan
###   topMenus        ← baris invoice dari invoice yang lunas (sejalan dengan settledAmount)
###   operations      ← dining & order
###   recentActivity  ← order terbaru + billingStatus dari invoice aktif
### Satu-satunya jalur uang adalah POST /payments (B2 ditutup) — kas & billing bergerak dari jalur yang sama.
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard summary - explicit range
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard/summary?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard summary - single day
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard/summary?from=2026-09-07&to=2026-09-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard summary - month to date
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard/summary?from=2026-09-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard summary - invalid ('to' before 'from') (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard/summary?from=2026-09-07&to=2026-09-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard summary - no auth (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard/summary
